Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:02:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] LWE/SIS Efficient: read PolyExpr.eval through its lemmas;
 reuse List.count_ofFn

The instance readers and centeredSampleEq_zero now read PolyExpr.eval through
eval_const/eval_add/eval_var/eval_mul/eval_pow (seal variant B), and the count of
ones of List.ofFn g is derived from List.count_ofFn (Programs/Util/List.lean)
as count_true_ofFn_eq_sum, replacing the local induction.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PqpVTmDD9txtmcmydGy4q5
